{"title":"2019 CIME I Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Albert, Bob, Carrie, and Douglas are travelling along a road at constant (but not necessarily equal) velocities<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d52dd46b7fc4df2f724b5af4311a675147cd6e8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.$\" width=\"3\" height=\"2\" /> Albert meets Bob at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/b/aab517f2741bfa50c7f6dd88ff4930cd04014557.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12:00 \\text{pm},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" /> Carrie at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/e/06e814addcd055cadff0f74a050356d6d7ba1fad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12:20 \\text{pm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /> and Douglas at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a23e66d2e712883a2759300ab825bb176c6dc34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12:32\\text{pm}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" /> Later that same day, Douglas meets Carrie at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/d/bad23ef5428c91cec9d24528d592c9e60cf6bcd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12:53\\text{pm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> and Bob at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/b/f5bf6ba867511b18b78f2e9050f1ac6503ab3a14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:17\\text{pm}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" /> If Bob and Carrie meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> minutes after noon, compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIME_I&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIME I (page does not exist)\">2019 CIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIME_I_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIME I Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIME_I_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIME I Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2019\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIME I Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2019 CIME I Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIME I Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIME I Problems/Problem 2 (page 